  "Posted 12 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The strategy gives the starting cards: the Objective, any Cloud City site ('doesn't really matter'), Prepared Defenses ('Prep D'), I'm Sorry, Crush The Rebellion and Combat Response. Prepared Defenses is not in the 60-card list, so no starting interrupt is set; the others are counted in their sections.",
